<title>INDIA: TENNIS-INDIAN OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-INDIAN OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MADRAS, India 1997-04-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results of the $430,000 Indian Open men's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>5-Alex Radulescu (Germany) beat Gerard Solves (France) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>6-Mikael Tillstrom (Sweden) beat Andrei Pavel (Romania)  6-3</p>
<p>6-3.</p>
</text>
